:"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment: Operation multiple times allowed children sit on carpet that smelled of mildew and was damp from a kitchen drainage entering from the wall.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026627504","violation_type_title":"Maintenance of Building, Grounds and Equipment (26 TAC §746.3407)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1003-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112","date":"2024-11-12","original_code":"746.1003(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-12-03","finding":"Director Responsibilities - Operate in Compliance: Director failed to ensure compliance of the minimum standards by not following code enforcement?s restrictions, which were to not use the facilities kitchen until clogged plumbing and flooding of the area was fixed, as well as instructing staff not to abide by the same authority.     Director failed to ensure the flooding was reported to CCR and parents, as well as not providing a safe environment for children, of which were allowed to maintain in the classroom the flooded water had entered.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026627505","violation_type_title":"Director Responsibilities - Operate in Compliance (26 TAC §746.1003(1))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3317","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112","date":"2024-11-12","original_code":"746.3317","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-12-03","finding":"Food Service and Preparation Requirement - Safe and Sanitary: Dishes were cleaned in hand washing sinks inside the utility closet and in the kitchen at the operation with only soap and water.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026627508","violation_type_title":"Food Service and Preparation Requirement - Safe and Sanitary (26 TAC §746.3317)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-305-a-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112","date":"2024-11-12","original_code":"746.305(a)(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-12-03","finding":"Report Unsafe Facility Occurrence: Operation failed to notify CCR that the kitchen had flooded due to the grease trap being clogged.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026627502","violation_type_title":"Report Unsafe Facility Occurrence (26 TAC §746.305(a)(1))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-307-b-5","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112","date":"2024-11-12","original_code":"746.307(b)(5)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-12-03","finding":"Parental Communication - Program Unsafe: Parents were not notified of flooding in the kitchen.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026627503","violation_type_title":"Parental Communication - Program Unsafe (26 TAC §746.307(b)(5))","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241112","date":"2024-11-12","original_code":"746.3701","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-12-03","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: Operation failed to comply with Code Enforcement when instructed to not use the kitchen until plumbing was fixed.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026627507","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1330563-i20241001","date":"2024-10-0